(footprint "TYWE2L_Legs_7P_2.0mm"
  (version 20241229)
  (generator "pcbnew")
  (generator_version "9.0")
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Tuya TYWE2L host interface: 7 through-hole legs in a single row, 2.0 mm pitch, 12.0 mm span, on a 15.0 mm wide vertical daughtercard. Outer leg centres are 1.436 mm from the left edge and 1.564 mm from the right edge (TYWE2L datasheet v20210119, Figure 3, page 16), so the row is 0.064 mm off centre; that asymmetry is reproduced deliberately. Footprint origin is the midpoint of the carrier bottom edge, x increasing to the right when viewed from the FRONT (module/antenna) face. Pin 1 = GPIO14 is the leftmost leg in that view. HOLE DIAMETER 0.9 mm IS AN ASSUMPTION: the TYWE2L datasheet does not give the leg diameter. Caliper a physical part and re-cut this footprint before ordering boards. SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0")
  (tags "TYWE2L Tuya ESP8285 module legs 2.0mm through_hole")
